<title>JAPAN: Nippon Lace to cancel share issue plan.</title>
<headline>Nippon Lace to cancel share issue plan.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Lace Co Ltd said on Tuesday it will cancel plans for a third-party share allocation and will make an announcement at 6 p.m. (0900 GMT).</p>
<p>The company said in February that it would issue six million new shares at 590 yen per share in a third-party allocation.</p>
<p>Nippon Lace said at the time that the payment date would be March 12.</p>
</text>
